<template>
  <div class="risk-grid">
    <section class="risk-card imbalance-card">
      <header><div><h4>类别不均衡分析</h4><p>先比较各数据集的整体失衡程度，再定位样本过多、样本不足或缺失的具体类别。</p></div><span v-if="imbalanceDatasets.length" class="summary">{{ allClasses.length }} 个类别</span></header>

      <template v-if="imbalanceDatasets.length">
        <div class="imbalance-kpis">
          <article v-for="dataset in imbalanceDatasets" :key="dataset.id" class="dataset-kpi">
            <div class="dataset-kpi-title"><span><i :style="{background:dataset.color}"/>{{ dataset.name }}</span><em :class="dataset.levelClass">{{ dataset.level }}</em></div>
            <div class="dataset-kpi-values">
              <span><small>总样本</small><strong>{{ formatCount(dataset.total) }}</strong></span>
              <span><small>有效类别</small><strong>{{ dataset.presentClasses }}/{{ allClasses.length }}</strong></span>
              <span><small>Gini</small><strong>{{ dataset.gini.toFixed(3) }}</strong></span>
              <span><small>最大/最小</small><strong>{{ dataset.ratioLabel }}</strong></span>
              <span><small>缺失类别</small><strong :class="{warning:dataset.missingClasses}">{{ dataset.missingClasses }}</strong></span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="imbalance-panels">
          <section class="analysis-panel lorenz-panel">
            <div class="panel-heading"><div><h5>整体不均衡程度 · 洛伦兹曲线</h5><p>曲线越远离均衡线，不均衡程度越高；Gini 越接近 1，类别分布越集中。</p></div></div>
            <div class="model-legend lorenz-legend"><span class="ideal"><i/>完全均衡</span><span v-for="dataset in imbalanceDatasets" :key="dataset.id"><i :style="{background:dataset.color}"/>{{ dataset.name }} · Gini {{ dataset.gini.toFixed(3) }}</span></div>
            <div class="lorenz-stage">
              <svg ref="lorenzSvg" viewBox="0 0 720 292" preserveAspectRatio="none" @mousemove="handleLorenzMove" @mouseleave="lorenzHoverIndex=null">
                <g class="grid"><line v-for="tick in percentTicks" :key="'lgx'+tick" :x1="lorenzX(tick/100)" :x2="lorenzX(tick/100)" y1="18" y2="244"/><line v-for="tick in percentTicks" :key="'lgy'+tick" x1="58" x2="704" :y1="lorenzY(tick/100)" :y2="lorenzY(tick/100)"/></g>
                <line class="axis" x1="58" x2="704" y1="244" y2="244"/><line class="axis" x1="58" x2="58" y1="18" y2="244"/>
                <line class="equality-line" x1="58" y1="244" x2="704" y2="18"/>
                <g class="labels"><text v-for="tick in percentTicks" :key="'lx'+tick" :x="lorenzX(tick/100)" y="264">{{ tick }}%</text><text v-for="tick in percentTicks" :key="'ly'+tick" x="49" :y="lorenzY(tick/100)+4" class="y-label">{{ tick }}%</text><text x="381" y="286" class="axis-title">累计类别占比</text><text x="18" y="135" class="vertical-title" transform="rotate(-90 18 135)">累计样本占比</text></g>
                <polyline v-for="dataset in imbalanceDatasets" :key="dataset.id" class="lorenz-line" :points="dataset.lorenzPointsText" :stroke="dataset.color"/>
                <g v-if="lorenzHoverIndex!==null" class="hover-layer"><line :x1="lorenzHoverX" :x2="lorenzHoverX" y1="18" y2="244"/><circle v-for="item in lorenzHoverValues" :key="item.id" :cx="lorenzHoverX" :cy="lorenzY(item.share)" r="5" :fill="item.color"/></g>
              </svg>
              <div v-if="lorenzHoverIndex!==null" class="tooltip lorenz-tooltip" :class="{right:lorenzPointerPercent>65}" :style="lorenzTooltipStyle"><strong>累计 {{ lorenzCategoryShare }}% 类别</strong><div v-for="item in lorenzHoverValues" :key="item.id"><i :style="{background:item.color}"/><span>{{ item.name }}</span><b>{{ (item.share*100).toFixed(1) }}%</b></div></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="analysis-panel heatmap-panel">
            <div class="panel-heading"><div><h5>类别偏离与缺失 · 归一化热力图</h5><p>单元格表示该类别样本数相对于本数据集平均每类样本数的倍数，已消除数据集规模差异。</p></div></div>
            <div class="heatmap-legend"><span>样本不足</span><i v-for="stop in heatmapLegend" :key="stop.value" :style="{background:heatColor(stop.value)}"><b>{{ stop.label }}</b></i><span>样本过多</span><em>斜纹 = 缺失</em></div>
            <div class="heatmap-scroll">
              <div class="heatmap-grid" :style="heatmapGridStyle">
                <div class="heatmap-corner">类别</div><div v-for="dataset in imbalanceDatasets" :key="'hh'+dataset.id" class="heatmap-column"><i :style="{background:dataset.color}"/>{{ dataset.name }}</div>
                <template v-for="row in heatmapRows" :key="row.class">
                  <div class="heatmap-class" :title="row.class">{{ row.class }}</div>
                  <div v-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id" class="heatmap-cell" :class="{missing:cell.missing}" :style="cell.missing?{}:{background:heatColor(cell.logRatio)}" :title="cell.title"><strong>{{ cell.missing ? '缺失' : `${cell.ratio.toFixed(2)}×` }}</strong><small>{{ formatCount(cell.count) }}</small></div>
                </template>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-note">类别按最大偏离程度排序；1.00× 表示达到该数据集平均水平，2.00× 表示平均水平的两倍。</div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </template>
      <div v-else class="empty">当前模型没有可用的类别实例数</div>
    </section>

    <section class="risk-card tst-card">
      <header><div><h4>时敏目标类别指标 <small>TST / TCT</small></h4><p>航空器、舰船、机动车辆等位置或状态快速变化目标；纵轴为各模型逐类别召回率。</p></div><span v-if="tstCategories.length" class="summary danger">{{ tstCategories.length }} 类</span></header>
      <div v-if="tstDatasets.length" class="model-legend"><span v-for="model in tstDatasets" :key="model.id"><i :style="{background:model.color}"/>{{ model.name }}</span></div>
      <div v-if="tstCategories.length" ref="tstStage" class="line-stage">
        <svg ref="tstSvg" viewBox="0 0 720 310" preserveAspectRatio="none" @mousemove="handleMove" @mouseleave="hoverIndex=null">
          <g class="grid"><line v-for="tick in yTicks" :key="tick.value" x1="58" x2="704" :y1="tick.y" :y2="tick.y"/></g>
          <line class="axis" x1="58" x2="704" y1="244" y2="244"/><line class="axis" x1="58" x2="58" y1="18" y2="244"/>
          <g class="labels"><text v-for="tick in yTicks" :key="'y'+tick.value" x="49" :y="tick.y+4" class="y-label">{{ tick.value.toFixed(2) }}</text><text x="18" y="135" class="vertical-title" transform="rotate(-90 18 135)">召回率</text><g v-for="(item,index) in tstCategories" :key="item.class" :transform="`translate(${pointX(index)},0)`"><text y="266">{{ item.class }}</text><text y="284" class="instances">{{ item.instances }} instances</text></g></g>
          <g v-for="model in tstChartModels" :key="model.id"><polyline v-for="segment in model.segments" :key="segment.key" :points="segment.points" :stroke="model.color"/><circle v-for="point in model.points" :key="point.class" :cx="point.x" :cy="point.y" r="4" :fill="model.color"/></g>
          <g v-if="hoverIndex!==null" class="hover-layer"><line :x1="pointX(hoverIndex)" :x2="pointX(hoverIndex)" y1="18" y2="244"/><circle v-for="item in hoverValues" :key="item.id" :cx="pointX(hoverIndex)" :cy="pointY(item.value)" r="5" :fill="item.color"/></g>
        </svg>
        <div v-if="hoverIndex!==null&&hoverValues.length" class="tooltip" :class="{right:pointerPercent>65}" :style="tooltipStyle"><strong>{{ tstCategories[hoverIndex].class }} <small>{{ tstCategories[hoverIndex].instances }} instances</small></strong><div v-for="item in hoverValues" :key="item.id"><i :style="{background:item.color}"/><span>{{ item.name }}</span><b>{{ item.value.toFixed(3) }}</b></div></div>
        <div class="rule-note">判定来源：数据显式 TST/TCT 标记；或航空器编号及飞机、舰船、车辆、坦克、直升机、无人机、雷达车等类别关键词。</div>
      </div>
      <div v-else class="empty">当前类别中未识别到时敏目标</div>
    </section>
  </div>
</template>

<script>
export default {
  name: 'OperationalRiskCharts',
  props: { models: { type: Array, default: () => [] }, selected: { type: Array, default: () => [] }, colors: { type: Array, default: () => [] } },
  data: () => ({ hoverIndex: null, pointerPercent: 0, lorenzHoverIndex: null, lorenzPointerPercent: 0 }),
  computed: {
    datasets () { return this.models.filter(model => this.selected.includes(model.id)).map(model => ({ id: model.id, name: model.name, color: this.modelColor(model.id), values: this.rows(model), model })) },
    allClasses () { const names = new Set(); this.datasets.forEach(model => model.values.forEach(row => { if (row.class && Number.isFinite(Number(row.instances))) names.add(String(row.class).trim()) })); return [...names] },
    imbalanceDatasets () { return this.datasets.filter(dataset => dataset.values.some(row => Number(row.instances) > 0)).map(dataset => { const counts = this.allClasses.map(name => { const row = dataset.values.find(item => String(item.class).trim() === name); return row && Number.isFinite(Number(row.instances)) ? Math.max(0, Number(row.instances)) : 0 }); const total = counts.reduce((sum, value) => sum + value, 0); const present = counts.filter(value => value > 0); const sorted = [...counts].sort((a, b) => a - b); let cumulative = 0; const points = [{ x: this.lorenzX(0), y: this.lorenzY(0), share: 0 }]; sorted.forEach((value, index) => { cumulative += value; const share = total ? cumulative / total : 0; points.push({ x: this.lorenzX((index + 1) / sorted.length), y: this.lorenzY(share), share }) }); const gini = this.gini(counts); const missingClasses = counts.length - present.length; const ratio = present.length ? Math.max(...present) / Math.min(...present) : 0; return { ...dataset, counts, total, presentClasses: present.length, missingClasses, gini, ratioLabel: missingClasses ? '∞' : `${ratio.toFixed(1)}×`, level: gini <= .2 ? '较均衡' : gini <= .4 ? '中度失衡' : '严重失衡', levelClass: gini <= .2 ? 'balanced' : gini <= .4 ? 'moderate' : 'severe', lorenzPoints: points, lorenzPointsText: points.map(point => `${point.x},${point.y}`).join(' ') } }) },
    percentTicks () { return [0, 20, 40, 60, 80, 100] },
    lorenzHoverX () { return this.lorenzX(this.lorenzHoverIndex / Math.max(this.allClasses.length, 1)) },
    lorenzCategoryShare () { return Math.round(this.lorenzHoverIndex / Math.max(this.allClasses.length, 1) * 100) },
    lorenzHoverValues () { if (this.lorenzHoverIndex === null) return []; return this.imbalanceDatasets.map(dataset => ({ id: dataset.id, name: dataset.name, color: dataset.color, share: dataset.lorenzPoints[this.lorenzHoverIndex] ? dataset.lorenzPoints[this.lorenzHoverIndex].share : 0 })).sort((a, b) => b.share - a.share) },
    lorenzTooltipStyle () { return this.lorenzPointerPercent > 65 ? { right: `${Math.max(2, 100 - this.lorenzPointerPercent + 2)}%` } : { left: `${Math.min(78, this.lorenzPointerPercent + 2)}%` } },
    heatmapLegend () { return [{ value: -2, label: '≤¼×' }, { value: -1, label: '½×' }, { value: 0, label: '1×' }, { value: 1, label: '2×' }, { value: 2, label: '≥4×' }] },
    heatmapRows () { return this.allClasses.map(name => { const cells = this.imbalanceDatasets.map(dataset => { const index = this.allClasses.indexOf(name); const count = dataset.counts[index] || 0; const mean = dataset.total / Math.max(this.allClasses.length, 1); const ratio = mean ? count / mean : 0; const missing = count <= 0; const logRatio = missing ? -3 : Math.log2(ratio); return { id: `${dataset.id}-${name}`, count, ratio, logRatio, missing, title: `${dataset.name} · ${name}\n${missing ? '该类别缺失' : `${this.formatCount(count)} 个实例 · 平均水平的 ${ratio.toFixed(2)} 倍`}` } }); const maxDeviation = Math.max(...cells.map(cell => cell.missing ? 3 : Math.abs(cell.logRatio))); return { class: name, cells, maxDeviation } }).sort((a, b) => b.maxDeviation - a.maxDeviation || a.class.localeCompare(b.class, 'zh-CN', { numeric: true })) },
    heatmapGridStyle () { return { gridTemplateColumns: `minmax(105px,180px) repeat(${this.imbalanceDatasets.length},minmax(92px,1fr))` } },
    tstDatasets () { return this.datasets.map(model => ({ ...model, values: model.values.filter(row => this.isTst(row, model.model) && this.score(row) !== null).map(row => ({ ...row, value: this.score(row) })) })).filter(model => model.values.length) },
    tstCategories () { const result = new Map(); this.tstDatasets.forEach(model => model.values.forEach(row => { const current = result.get(row.class) || []; current.push(Number(row.instances) || 0); result.set(row.class, current) })); return [...result].map(([name, counts]) => ({ class: name, instances: Math.round(this.median(counts)) })).sort((a, b) => a.instances - b.instances || a.class.localeCompare(b.class, 'zh-CN', { numeric: true })) },
    yTicks () { return Array.from({ length: 6 }, (_, index) => ({ value: 1 - index * .2, y: 18 + index * 45.2 })) },
    tstChartModels () { return this.tstDatasets.map(model => { const points = this.tstCategories.flatMap((category, index) => { const row = model.values.find(item => item.class === category.class); return row ? [{ class: row.class, x: this.pointX(index), y: this.pointY(row.value), value: row.value, index }] : [] }); const segments = []; let current = []; points.forEach((point, index) => { if (index && point.index !== points[index - 1].index + 1) { if (current.length) segments.push(current); current = [] } current.push(point) }); if (current.length) segments.push(current); return { ...model, points, segments: segments.map((segment, index) => ({ key: `${model.id}-${index}`, points: segment.map(point => `${point.x},${point.y}`).join(' ') })) } }) },
    hoverValues () { if (this.hoverIndex === null) return []; const category = this.tstCategories[this.hoverIndex]; return this.tstDatasets.flatMap(model => { const row = model.values.find(item => item.class === category.class); return row ? [{ id: model.id, name: model.name, color: model.color, value: row.value }] : [] }).sort((a, b) => b.value - a.value) },
    tooltipStyle () { return this.pointerPercent > 65 ? { right: `${Math.max(2, 100 - this.pointerPercent + 2)}%` } : { left: `${Math.min(78, this.pointerPercent + 2)}%` } }
  },
  methods: {
    rows (model) { const metrics = model.metrics || {}; return Array.isArray(metrics.class_metrics) && metrics.class_metrics.length ? metrics.class_metrics.filter(row => !['all', 'overall', 'total'].includes(String(row.class || '').toLowerCase())) : (Array.isArray(metrics.small_sample) ? metrics.small_sample : []) },
    score (row) { if (row.recall === null || row.recall === undefined || row.recall === '') return null; const value = Number(row.recall); return Number.isFinite(value) ? Math.max(0, Math.min(1, value)) : null },
    isTst (row, model) { const metrics = model.metrics || {}; const names = [...(metrics.time_sensitive_classes || []), ...(metrics.tst_classes || []), ...(metrics.tct_classes || [])].map(value => String(value).toLowerCase()); const name = String(row.class || '').trim(); const lower = name.toLowerCase(); const explicit = row.time_sensitive === true || row.tst === true || row.tct === true || ['tst', 'tct', 'time_sensitive'].includes(String(row.target_type || '').toLowerCase()) || names.includes(lower); const keywords = /(plane|aircraft|fighter|bomber|transport.?aircraft|helicopter|uav|drone|ship|warship|vessel|boat|vehicle|truck|tank|armored|artillery|missile|launcher|radar|convoy|飞机|战机|轰炸机|运输机|直升机|无人机|舰|船|艇|车辆|汽车|卡车|坦克|装甲|火炮|导弹|发射车|雷达车|车队)/i; return explicit || /^A\d+[_-]/i.test(name) || keywords.test(lower) },
    median (values) { const sorted = [...values].sort((a, b) => a - b); const mid = Math.floor(sorted.length / 2); return sorted.length % 2 ? sorted[mid] : (sorted[mid - 1] + sorted[mid]) / 2 },
    modelColor (id) { const index = this.models.findIndex(model => model.id === id); return this.colors[index % this.colors.length] || '#3388ee' },
    gini (values) { const sorted = values.map(value => Math.max(0, Number(value) || 0)).sort((a, b) => a - b); const total = sorted.reduce((sum, value) => sum + value, 0); if (!sorted.length || !total) return 0; return sorted.reduce((sum, value, index) => sum + (2 * (index + 1) - sorted.length - 1) * value, 0) / (sorted.length * total) },
    lorenzX (share) { return 58 + Math.max(0, Math.min(1, share)) * 646 },
    lorenzY (share) { return 244 - Math.max(0, Math.min(1, share)) * 226 },
    handleLorenzMove (event) { const rect = this.$refs.lorenzSvg.getBoundingClientRect(); const viewX = (event.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width * 720; const clamped = Math.max(58, Math.min(704, viewX)); this.lorenzHoverIndex = Math.round((clamped - 58) / 646 * this.allClasses.length); this.lorenzPointerPercent = (event.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width * 100 },
    heatColor (logRatio) { const value = Math.max(-2, Math.min(2, Number(logRatio) || 0)); const strength = Math.abs(value) / 2; const hue = value < 0 ? 211 : 24; const saturation = Math.round(18 + strength * 60); const lightness = Math.round(96 - strength * 38); return `hsl(${hue} ${saturation}% ${lightness}%)` },
    formatCount (value) { return Number(value || 0).toLocaleString('zh-CN') },
    pointX (index) { return 58 + index / Math.max(this.tstCategories.length - 1, 1) * 646 }, pointY (value) { return 244 - value * 226 },
    handleMove (event) { const rect = this.$refs.tstSvg.getBoundingClientRect(); const viewX = (event.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width * 720; const clamped = Math.max(58, Math.min(704, viewX)); this.hoverIndex = Math.round((clamped - 58) / 646 * Math.max(this.tstCategories.length - 1, 0)); this.pointerPercent = (event.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width * 100 }
  }
}
</script>

<style scoped>
.risk-grid{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:13px}.risk-card{min-width:0;padding:15px;border:1px solid #e1e5eb;border-radius:14px;background:#fff}.risk-card header{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:11px}.risk-card h4{margin:0;color:#283448;font-size:14px}.risk-card h4 small{color:#8a94a3;font-weight:500}.risk-card p{margin:5px 0 0;color:#8791a0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}.summary{flex:none;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef5ff;color:#327dcc;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.summary.danger{background:#fff1eb;color:#d87530}.model-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px 13px;margin-bottom:10px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;color:#657184;font-size:9px}.model-legend span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.model-legend i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%}.imbalance-chart{max-height:285px;overflow:auto;padding-right:4px}.scale{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:0 42px 6px 90px;color:#9aa3b0;font-size:9px}.category-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:82px minmax(100px,1fr);align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f3f6}.class-name{overflow:hidden;color:#526074;font-size:10px;text-align:right;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.model-bars{display:grid;gap:3px}.bar-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(70px,1fr) 34px;align-items:center;gap:6px}.track{height:5px;border-radius:4px;background:#edf1f5}.track i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:4px}.bar-line strong{color:#536074;font-size:8px}.line-stage{position:relative}.line-stage svg{display:block;width:100%;height:310px;overflow:visible;cursor:crosshair}.grid line{stroke:#e9edf2;stroke-width:1}.axis{stroke:#bdc6d2;stroke-width:1}.labels text{fill:#536074;font-size:9px;text-anchor:middle}.labels .y-label{text-anchor:end}.labels .instances{fill:#8b95a4;font-size:8px}polyline{fill:none;stroke-width:2.3;vector-